				<section class="pdd-btm-10 pdd-top-1">
        <div class="container">
           <h2 class="mrg-top-10"><strong>First-Class Web Hosting</strong> in Amsterdam with <strong>Fully Managed Solutions</strong> for video streaming sites. <strong>CDN</strong> with HLS and MP4. <strong>Own Private Cloud</strong>. Built For Those Who Value Their Time.</h2>
        <!-- /container -->
</section>

<section class="pdd-btm-10 pdd-top-10">
        <div class="container">
            <!-- /column -->
            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 text-center pdd-top-10 text-center wow fadeInUp" data-wow-duration="1s" data-wow-delay="0.6s">
                <img class="img-responsive img-responsive mrg-horizon-auto mrg-top-10" src="/app/views/client/responsive/images/super_vds_main.png" alt="Cloud Servers">
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 pdd-left-10  wow fadeInUp" data-wow-duration="2s" data-wow-delay="0.1s">
                <h2 class="mrg-top-10"><b>Cloud Servers in Amsterdam</b></h2>
                <p class="mrg-top-10">
                    Our Cloud Servers are instances in the Private Host (tm) High Performance Cloud and are targeted as a replacement for traditional dedicated servers which we think are just outdated. We trust that it is especially important to have ultra high performance and hyper-scalable solutions if you plan to create video streaming sites. All our Cloud Servers will be created and delivered on the same day. Night orders will be delivered next morning. We are not resellers of Amazon AWS or Microsoft Azure. We have our own infrastructure.
                </p>
                <ul class="list icon-angle-circle mrg-top-30">
                    <li>Ultra High Performance: Your instance will run on Xeon Gold powered nodes.</li>
                    <li>High Availability: Immediate recover in case of real hardware failure.</li>
                    <li>Ultra Fast File System: Full NVM-E 4.0 powered Cloud Storage.</il>
                    <li>Data Protection: Triple replication of all your data. Yes, we store 3 copies.</il>
                    <li>Free Online Backups: Rollback your data as of last Day, Week, Month or Year</li>
                    <li>24/7 Pro-Active Monitoring. </li>
                    <li>Cloud Network with 99.995% uptime. </li>
                    <li>Custom tailored. Any configuration is possible. </li>
                    <li>Nvidia GPU: Support of CUDA and NVENC/NVDEC.</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/order/main/index/cloud-servers-amsterdam/" class="btn btn-md btn-style-2 mrg-top-20">Order now</a>
            </div>
            <!-- /column -->
        </div>
        <!-- /container -->
    </section>

<section class="pdd-btm-10 pdd-top-1">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 text-center pdd-top-10 text-center wow fadeInUp" data-wow-duration="1s" data-wow-delay="0.6s">
                <img class="img-responsive img-responsive mrg-horizon-auto mrg-top-10" src="/app/views/client/responsive/images/cloud_vds_main.png" alt="VPS/VDS Servers">
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 pdd-left-10  wow fadeInUp" data-wow-duration="2s" data-wow-delay="0.1s">
                <h2 class="mrg-top-10"><b>VDS/VPS Servers in Amsterdam</b></h2>
                <p class="mrg-top-10">
                    We proudly present our ultra high performance Virtual Dedicated Servers (VDS), also known as Virtual Private Servers (VPS), which are suitable for all your needs. All our VPS/VDS are hosted on powerful nodes loaded with Intel Xeon® Gold CPUs and ultra high speed NVM-E 4.0 drives of the last generation, the fastest disks up to the time. We use only super modern and powerful hardware for our VDS, so just try it and you will love it.
                </p>
                <ul class="list icon-angle-circle mrg-top-30">
                    <li>99.99% Uptime</li>
                    <li>Based on Intel® Xeon® Gold powered nodes</il>
                    <li>100% NVME for ultra fast disk speed</il>
                    <li>Fully redundant cluster</li>
                    <li>Live backup of entire disk image</li>
                    <li>Unmetered traffic with every VDS we offer</li>
                    <li>Control Panel of your choice</li>
                    <li>Unbeatable performance</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/order/main/index/vps-amsterdam-netherlands/" class="btn btn-md btn-style-2 mrg-top-20">Order now</a>
            </div>
            <!-- /column -->
        </div>
        <!-- /container -->
</section>

<section class="pdd-btm-10 pdd-top-10">
        <div class="container">
            <!-- /column -->
            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 text-center pdd-top-10 text-center wow fadeInUp" data-wow-duration="1s" data-wow-delay="0.6s">
                <img class="img-responsive img-responsive mrg-horizon-auto mrg-top-10" src="/app/views/client/responsive/images/super_cdn_main.png" alt="CDN for Video">
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 pdd-left-10  wow fadeInUp" data-wow-duration="2s" data-wow-delay="0.1s">
                <h2 class="mrg-top-10"><b>CDN for Video with HLS, Anycast and NVM-E</b></h2>
                <p class="mrg-top-10">
                    Private Host's own CDN is built according to the highest industry standards for video content delivery. Loaded with 100% NVM-E 4.0 ssd drives and multiple 100Gbps and modern 400Gbps uplinks in various locations, it can accommodate projects of virtually any size. Anycast technology guarantees the shortest path on network level from our servers to your visitors. HLS technology guarantees lighting fast video start and rewind as well as automatic best resolution selection based on 3G/4G/5G signal quality. 
                </p>
                <ul class="list icon-angle-circle mrg-top-30">
                    <li>True Anycast CDN with best path guaranteed on network level.</li>
                    <li>HLS and MP4 video streaming. Real time conversion MP4 -> HLS</il>
                    <li>Integration with KVS or other CMS, we will do it for you</il>
                    <li>Multi Level Anti Hotlink Protection to keep your content only on your sites. </il>
                    <li>Buffer & Bandwidth Limit of your choice.</il>
                    <li>100% NVM-E drives of 4th generation for maximin speed.</li>
                    <li>Over 1PB of cloud storage capacity to accomodate any projects.</li>
                    <li>Over 1.5TBps of network capacity guarantees no bottlenecs in peak hours.</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/order/main/index/cdn-for-video" class="btn btn-md btn-style-2 mrg-top-20">Order now</a>
            </div>
            <!-- /column -->
        </div>
        <!-- /container -->
</section>

    <section class="pdd-btm-10 pdd-top-10">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 text-center wow fadeInUp" data-wow-duration="1s" data-wow-delay="0.6s">
                <img class="img-responsive img-responsive mrg-horizon-auto mrg-top-30" src="/app/views/client/responsive/images/ddos_shield_main.png" alt="DDoS Protection">
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 pdd-top-10 pdd-left-10 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-duration="2s" data-wow-delay="0.1s">
                <h2 class="mrg-top-10"><b>DDoS Protection</b></h2>
                <p class="mrg-top-10">
                    To protect our customers against DDoS attacks, we are using geo-distributed scrubbing network with scrubbing centers in The Netherlands, Germany, Singapore and Japan. It allows us to offer a high-level DDOS protection service to our end customers and provide full protection against attacks with volumes up to 1.5 Tbps. We are using Reverse Proxy DDOS protection for immediate mitigation of DDOS. For the customers who want 24/7/365 automatic protection against DDOS, we are offering protected hosting solutions. Please contact us for more information about it.
                </p>
                <ul class="list icon-angle-circle mrg-top-30">
                    <li>Geo-distributed scrubbing centers</li>
                    <li>Protection against 1.5Tbps / 300 Mpps attacks</li>
                    <li>Instant activation (usually less than 10 minutes to full mitigate)</li>
                    <li>Direct communication to our NOC/Admins in Telegram</li>
                    <li>Protection from volumentric and deep L7 attacks</li>
                    <li>Automatic 24/7 protection only for our customers</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/order/main/index/ddos-protection/" class="btn btn-md btn-style-2 mrg-top-30">Order Now</a>
            </div>
            <!-- /column -->
        </div>
        <!-- /container -->
    </section>
	
<section class="pdd-btm-10 pdd-top-10">
        <div class="container">
            <!-- /column -->
            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 pdd-top-20 text-center wow fadeInLeft" data-wow-duration="2s" data-wow-delay="0.1s">
                <img class="img-responsive mrg-horizon-auto" src="/app/views/client/responsive/images/remote_hands4.png"  alt="Remote Hands in Amsterdam">
