                <p class="mrg-top-10">
		If you have your equipment located in the Amsterdam area and you need urgent assistance during an outage or you need to perform any kind of complicated job which your datatacenter support can not do for you - feel free to contact us. As a resident of Amsterdam, we can offer you a fast response time and provide you with any kind of assistance in any datacenter available here - NIKHEF housing, Interxion AMS9, Equinix AM3/AM4/AM6, Digital Realty AMS1 (also know as Amsterdam Data Tower), Switch Datacenter. Remote hands are also available in any other datacenter in the Netherlands with a small travel fee applied. 
		</p>

                <ul class="list icon-angle-circle mrg-top-30">
                    <li>Fast Response time (usually 30 minutes or so)</li>
                    <li>Any datacenter in the Netherlands</li>
                    <li>Any kind of job including deep troubleshooting of your gear</li>
                    <li>Support in English</li>
                    <li>Online translation of work in WhatsApp / Viber / Telegram</li>
                    <li>Planned or urgent calls</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/order/main/index/smart-hands-amsterdam" class="btn btn-md btn-style-2 mrg-top-30">Order Now</a>
            </div>

